; The simple case of the layered layout: two declarations, a property of a relation, four facts about names.
; Written for the review; the program of 12-rendering.md's drawing 12-layers.
(relation owns Person Pet :why "{?3} owns {?4}")
(relation lives-in Person House :why "{?3} lives in {?4}")
(symmetric owns)
(owns Alice Dog)
(owns Bob Cat)
(lives-in Alice House-1)
(lives-in Bob House-2)
